const GOV_TEXT=[
 `ODISSEI is the Dutch National Infrastructure for Social Science and provides access to a federated set of services to ODISSEI member organisations. Its mission is to enable researchers to leverage comprehensive data, computing power and expertise for studies that shape policy and society.`,
 `Through ODISSEI, researchers have access to large-scale, longitudinal data collections as well as innovative and diverse new forms of data. These can be linked to administrative data at Statistics Netherlands (CBS). Combining data from a wide range of sources enables researchers to answer new, exciting, interdisciplinary research questions and to investigate existing questions in novel ways. ODISSEI now consists of 44 member organisations.`
];
